WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.110
H-Here goes, um, Sazanka.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.700
N-No! I can't take it off!

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.840
Okay.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:33.970
<i>This</i> time.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:36.720
No!

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:37.140
No!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:37.850
No!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.640
Wh-Whoops...

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.390
I'm still too shy!

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.740
<b>Rindou's Resolve</b>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.040
<b>Dog</b>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.420
What are you up to 
first thing in the morning?

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.440
W-Well, I thought I'd look at Rindou's face.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.180
You can't just take it off without asking.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.120
You know she's shy about 
being seen without it.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:42.800
But!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:43.930
No buts.

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.980
<b>Soy
Sauce</b>

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.980
What's the big deal, anyway?!

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:56.320
And how long does she plan to wear a mask?!

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.730
Um...

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.820
See, Rindou is a shy person.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:04.700
What's with the "I'm so embarrassed"?!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.990
Over her cute face, of all things!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.340
My fish!

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:12.460
Cute?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.000
What's wrong, Hinagiku?

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.000
Give back my fish!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.710
Didn't Sazanka just say that Rindou's cute?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.710
Shut up. If you want to 
blame someone, blame Rindou.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:21.270
Was she talking about that?

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.600
She was.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.890
I knew it.

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:28.050
But if she's cute, there's no reason
 for her to wear a mask, is there?

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.730
That's very true.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.270
You never know.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.400
Sazanka isn't the type to just toss 
around compliments like "cute."

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.280
Why'd you call us out to a place like this?

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.700
So, is what you said earlier true?

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.210
Earlier?

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.170
You're so dense.

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:55.210
Weren't you saying that Rindou is cute?

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.000
Oh, that?

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.880
Well, who can say?

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.880
It's true!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.990
I saw when we were bathing!

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.360
You don't need to engage with them.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.620
Now that I've heard she's cute,

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.040
there's no way I'm <i>not</i> going to make sure.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:12.850
Mhm!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.120
Right?

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:15.990
What, then?

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.610
Listen, I want to take off Rindou's mask.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.130
Care to help me?

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.110
Oh yeah?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:26.510
Don't do that! It's not good to force her!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.550
Asagao.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:29.350
But...

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.250
I'll give you my side dishes at dinner.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.870
Just do as I say.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.760
Oh, I didn't think you'd be so into it.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:41.840
You must have plenty of gripes about Rindou.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:46.700
Whatever. Just tell us the plan.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:57.350
Maybe I did a bad thing.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:04.660
Because I don't want my face being 
seen, you got mad at Sazanka.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:08.080
You don't need to worry about it.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.070
But...

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:16.120
She probably wants lots of your 
attention, but she's awkward.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.750
She ends up going about it a bit childishly.

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.210
But you know, Rindou,

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:26.720
Sazanka is a very good, kind girl at heart.

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:29.880
So, there's no need to worry.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.180
All right.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.640
I'm stuck now.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:42.190
You're very careful with your mask.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.730
Looks like even the butterfly can tell.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:50.360
The head of my last village gave me 
this mask, on account of my shyness.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:06:00.630
Thanks to the mask, I reached a 
point where I could talk to people.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:05.000
You've been with it ever
 since you were little?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:10.370
Yeah, but I... don't think 
I can go on like this.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.590
You do it your way, Rindou.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:16.830
No need to force things.

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:27.280
<b>Oh! The Profundities
of Ninjutsu</b>

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.120
There, all done.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:45.730
I want to fit in better with everyone.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.160
I wonder if I can.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.400
Nee-sama! Rindou!

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:05.180
I fell asleep on my precious day off!

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.820
I wanted to read!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.680
Let's see, I think...

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:10.780
Huh?! How far had I gotten?!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.710
Nee-sama!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.240
Emergency! It's Hinagiku!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.040
Here's the plan.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.250
Emergency! Nee-sama!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.680
What's the matter, Sazanka?

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:26.480
Hinagiku's pinned under a tree over there!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.670
Oh, my!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:30.530
Rindou, come with us to rescue her!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:33.760
Nee-sama, you go and get more help!

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.580
Will do!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.900
This way Tsubaki won't come,

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:43.310
so all that's left to do is remove 
the unsuspecting Rindou's mask.

00:07:43.800 --> 00:07:44.820
Well?

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:47.660
Flawless, isn't it?

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:49.740
It's perfect, Hinagiku!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:53.820
The more smoothly things go, 
the more cautious you should be.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:57.660
You're so uptight, Oniyuri. It'll be fine.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.870
Will it?

00:07:58.870 --> 00:07:59.830
Here they come!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.790
Now that I've heard she's cute, 
there's no way I'm not going to make sure.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.560
Hinagiku!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:10.920
Huh?

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.880
I thought you were pinned under a tree.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.760
What?! What?!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.980
Too bad! It was a lie.

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:32.680
Sazanka has some issues 
with you, so she helped me.

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.580
It was bribery for Asagao.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:44.120
Now, let's take that mask off 
before Tsubaki gets here.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.820
"Before Tsubaki gets here"?

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:47.580
Huh?

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:50.460
I'm already here.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:51.510
Release!

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.270
No way!

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.400
Hinagiku!

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:08.900
Sorry.

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.260
You tricked me, Sazanka?!

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:14.620
Sazanka would never go along 
with a plan like that.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:18.450
Why not? Weren't you displeased with Rindou?!

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:22.560
I think you've probably got it wrong.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.910
Wrong, how?

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:28.920
Sazanka messes with Rindou 
because she likes her.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:29.460
Right?

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.000
Well, I don't dislike her.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.270
I knew you were a good girl.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:41.770
I figured it out from Sazanka's eye signals!

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:43.580
You're a good girl, too.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.270
Stop right there!

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.270
What should we do with the bad girl?

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.340
D-Don't get so mad.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:57.650
I-I just thought I'd get a 
quick peek at Rindou's face.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.070
Rindou is important to us.

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:03.460
I-I know that.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:05.570
You can't do with her as you please!

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.120
Tsubaki, wait.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:08.840
Rindou!

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:14.340
What?!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.860
I'm sorry I caused trouble again.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:22.070
It isn't your fault, Rindou.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:27.510
No, this all started because I'm 
embarrassed about showing my face.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.690
But from now on...

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:40.300
I want to, little by little, 
get used to not wearing the mask.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:45.300
Um, thanks for giving me 
this excuse, Hinagiku.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:50.620
Hinagiku?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.080
Hah!

00:10:52.580 --> 00:10:56.000
Just when I was wondering 
how cute your face could be!

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.290
Guess it's more ordinary than I expected!

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.680
What a letdown, huh?!

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.590
Hinagiku...

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:09.130
You can just keep that mask on forever!

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:11.420
Um...

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.560
Hinagiku's crying!

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.440
Just ignore her, Rindou.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.520
Poor thing. Are you okay?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:14.520
Oh, but...

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:19.300
You're a hundred, no, 
a thousand times cuter.

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.680
So, don't cry.

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.380
I'm going home!

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:23.780
Yeah, let's go home.

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:25.790
Come on, stand up.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.250
There's a stone at your feet, 
so watch your step.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:33.010
Want to eat something sweet when we get back?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.500
Aren't you better off without the mask?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:36.500
I think we have some mandarin oranges.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:37.780
Y-Yeah...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.440
I'll have some!

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.670
I think so, too!

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:39.000
All right.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.420
I'll peel them for you!

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:40.420
Yeah.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.840
Please don't force yourself.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.100
Thank you.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:49.890
From now on, I'll try hard to get 
used to not wearing the mask.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:51.460
And so...

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:56.200
Sazanka, Asagao, Tsubaki.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.570
Once again, here's hoping 
for the best for us all.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.560
Yes, of course!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:03.910
I second that!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:04.910
What you said...

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.290
<b>Late-Night Summons</b>

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:14.140
Ready, go!

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.670
See you there.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.170
Wait, you!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:22.630
Not waiting.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:24.840
Take this!

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.680
See you there!

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.220
No fair!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.370
Rindou.

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.460
U-Um...

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:38.360
Something up?

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.520
There's something I want to ask you.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.010
That is...

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.360
Wh-What are...

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.070
What?

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:51.660
Uh, it's not like I care 
one way or the other...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.500
Um, about what?

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:59.250
Well, wh-what are men like?!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.420
What are they like?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.220
Wh-What?

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.360
Tell me anything, please.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.270
Anything, if it's about men!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.220
Tsubaki. Rindou.

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:19.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.690
C-Can we help you?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.400
Both of you, come by my place tonight.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.860
Let no one discover you.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.960
All right, good.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:38.160
She startled me.

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:39.500
But what's this about?

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.690
It might be for a scolding,

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:45.010
since I carelessly tried to ask about men.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.990
A scolding from Hana-sensei?

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:50.150
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.500
Nee-sama!

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.390
What did Hana-sensei have to say?

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.830
Oh, uh...

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.880
She just came to check on us.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.000
Right, right.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:06.860
Oh, I was watching your ropewalk. 
You were so quick!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.280
Is something wrong, Nee-sama?

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.890
You're acting funny.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:14.350
N-No, nothing's wrong at all.

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:22.900
We got out without anyone noticing.

00:14:22.900 --> 00:14:24.330
Yeah, probably.

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:28.840
To be safe, let's go through the 
forest and approach from behind.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.840
Okay.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:38.690
I'm sorry. It's my fault 
you got dragged into this.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:41.000
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.640
But, a scolding from Hana-sensei, huh?

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:45.320
I wonder if it's as scary as I think.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.520
I heard something once.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.530
A student was summoned for a scolding,

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:55.130
and it was so frightening,

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.330
she didn't get out of bed for three days!

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.530
Let's be strong.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:02.740
Yes, let's!

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.380
Where are you going so late, Nee-sama?

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:11.960
Sazanka!

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.510
But, weren't you asleep?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:16.390
That was a dummy.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.400
I was on alert because 
something seemed fishy.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.650
You already have me...

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:26.480
so where do you think you're going with 
Rindou in the middle of the night?!

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.400
She's awfully mad.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.240
For now, let's lose her!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.650
Stop!

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.910
Nee-sama!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.740
Wouldn't it be better to calm her down first?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.350
There's no assuaging Sazanka 
when she like this.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:51.120
Wonder if we gave her the slip.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:52.250
Most likely.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:56.600
Sazanka really does adore you.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:01.720
Maybe to her, this looks like an elopement.

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:03.480
Elopement?!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:06.690
<i>That thing men and women do?!</i>

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.860
Tsubaki, keep your voice down!

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.740
Elopement?

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:17.950
I don't know what that is, but it 
must be what you're trying to do.

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.760
I won't let you elopement!

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:25.620
Sazanka, that's not how you use the word!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.760
You don't need to tell her that!

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:29.580
Rindou!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.380
Sazanka! Over here!

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.260
Nee-sama!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.640
Nee-sama! Nee-sama! Nee-sama!

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.440
What did you do?

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:48.900
It's a sleep needle I got from Mokuren.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.840
Nee-sama...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.600
She won't wake up for a while,

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.740
so let's collect her on our way home.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:58.700
Okay.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.620
Tsubaki and Rindou reporting.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:07.040
<b>A
k
a
n
e

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:07.040
You seem tired.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.290
Did something happen?

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:12.040
N-No, ma'am. Nothing.

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.260
All right.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:27.190
Rindou, have you gotten used to the village?

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.020
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.460
Looks like you're moving 
closer to removing your mask.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.070
Yes, one way or another.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.350
I think the two of you realize this,

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.640
but exercise all due caution regarding men.

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:46.660
Don't speak carelessly of 
them in front of the others.

00:17:46.660 --> 00:17:47.670
Yes, ma'am.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.380
Is there anything troubling you?

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:56.630
No, ma'am. Tsubaki treats me well, 
and everyone is nice.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:58.180
I see.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.450
I've kept you long enough.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:02.890
Go home and get some decent sleep.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:03.730
Huh?

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.390
What is it?

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:10.560
N-Nothing, ma'am. I just thought there'd 
be more than this to a summons.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:11.230
Such as?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:13.860
N-Never mind! If there isn't, that's fine!

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:22.270
That was kind of a letdown.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:25.480
Good thing, though. 
I was sure the men thing—

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:27.280
I forgot something, Tsubaki.

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.000
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:32.710
This applies to Rindou, of course, 
but look after the rest, as well.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.250
Huh?

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.670
I have high hopes for you.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.390
Yes, ma'am! I'll do my best!

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:46.470
I found you, Nee-sama.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.850
S-Sazanka!

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.360
No way. She shouldn't have woken up so soon.

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:06.950
Didn't I tell you? Don't underestimate 
how strongly I feel for...

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.460
She fell back asleep?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.290
What is Sazanka doing here?

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:15.880
As it turns out, she noticed us sneak out.

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.240
I put her to sleep on the way here, but...

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.300
I'm sorry.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:25.160
Well, I'll let it go this time. 
Take her home.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.220
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:27.640
Ayoomp.

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.930
She's completely out now.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:30.740
Yeah.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.580
...sama...

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.640
Is she saying something?

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:39.280
Please, you and Rindou had better not elo—

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:42.760
What's wrong?

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:43.480
Oh!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.620
Nothing, ma'am!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.200
Let's get going, Rindou!

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.840
Let's go, let's go!

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.620
If you'll excuse us!

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:56.040
Well, I'm counting on you.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:06.950
Sazanka noticed that you seemed 
different than usual earlier today.

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:10.310
Sorry. I'm bad at covering stuff up.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:15.190
No, this is all Sazanka.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.040
She knows you well.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.160
Be that as it may, 
sneaking out in the night...

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:22.840
Bad girl.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.620
Nee-sama...

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:30.870
You eat some more, too, Rindou.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:39.050
<b>Dog</b>

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:38.000
No, on second thought, everyone 
in Team Dog's a good girl.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:39.050
Yeah.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.130
<b>Team
Dragon</b>

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:12.430
Somebody here is a bad girl!

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:15.320
Who ate my emergency stash?!

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:17.000
Fess up!

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:19.930
Tsubaki-chan?

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:20.880
No.

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:21.940
Rindou?

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:22.730
Not me.

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:24.770
I knew it was you, Sazanka!

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:26.400
"Knew," nothing! I didn't do it!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:29.710
Give back my potatoes!

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:32.520
Of course I'm not going to eat those!

00:22:32.520 --> 00:22:35.570
Now, now! Please calm down!

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:45.100
<i>Could it be Sazanka or Rindou?</i>

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:48.260
<i>No, no. I'm sure they're both good girls.</i>

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:56.180
<i>Someone got up.</i>

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:00.140
<i>She's eating the emergency food!</i>

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:03.000
<i>It's wrong to take what's not yours.</i>

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:05.110
<i>I've got to reprimand her!</i>

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.950
Who's the bad girl?!

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:13.090
Huh?

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:23.080
Give back my stash!

00:23:23.320 --> 00:23:25.840
A-Asagao...

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:28.880
Darn it.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:36.510
<i>E-Everyone in Team Dog's a good girl...</i>

00:23:36.510 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:39.300
T-To be continued.
